== Trivia ==
* The ID, or more accurately subtype, of a golden trinket is the normal ID + 32768. For example, the ID of Golden {{t|Cancer}} is 32807 (because it normally has an ID of 39).
** The [[Debug Console]] spawn code would in this case be 5.350.32807.
* Using the high damage debug flag, <code>debug 4</code>, causes all trinkets spawn as golden ones.
* {{dlc|rnr+}}Some golden trinkets do not have an effect due to them being added late in development.

== Bugs ==
{{bug|Golden trinkets rerolled by {{i|D20}} will cause the resulting pickup to have the golden effect applied to it. If this is a trinket, the trinket will turn into a standard trinket, otherwise the gold effect will do nothing and will disappear upon leaving and re-entering the room.
* Additionally, items spawned by [[chest]]s with the gold effect applied will be golden as well, however other pickups dropped by chests will not be.}}

